        "initialization": "",
        "initializationLanguageId": "",
        "specification": "One request/response exchange: `id` \"req-<n>\" unique per server run, `connection` socket descriptor, the parsed `request`, and the `response` filled downstream. See the ownership rules in the WebServer specification.",
